					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-662812#post-1799143</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-662812/local-legends#post-1799143</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 18 Jun 2013 13:51:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>HammerMaiden</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1552358</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Good old fashioned storytelling. I'm very fond of it, and I find myself really feeling for Goatman and his dying legend.</p> <p>Makes you think about a lot of our old stories, actually. So much of what makes us human is that narrative thread we've woven through our prehistory, history, past, present, and desperately hope to impose on an uncertain future. And sometimes I do fear that the thread is growing thin, and when it breaks, something valuable about us will be lost forever&#8230;</p> <p>You should feel good about yourself.</p> <p>+1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
